   "value": "body_swap:  subject_definitions: <Subject 1> is the {details} shown in <Picture 1>, whose identity, face, head, hair or fur, skin, body shape, proportions and clothing define the character in the target video. The guide video provides the scene and the performance: its background, environment, lighting, camera, framing, body pose, hand and arm movement, head rotation, gaze direction, lip movement and facial expression, frame by frame; only {target} is replaced: their face, hair, body and clothing become <Subject 1>.  summary: [video generation + reference] Replace {target} in the guide video with <Subject 1>, keeping the scene, camera and the complete motion and performance of the guide video.  detailed_description: [Shot 1] <Subject 1> takes the exact place of {target} and moves with the same timing, body pose, gestures, head motion, gaze, speech and facial expressions, while keeping the complete look from <Picture 1>: head, face, skin, hair or fur, body shape and clothing stay stable in every frame, with no trace of the original subject's face, hair or clothing. The background, lighting, colors and camera of the guide video are preserved. Prevent identity drift, clothing changes, texture crawling and flicker. The result is a real, photographic video."
